{"headword":"אָמַן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. confirm, support (</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَمِنَ</span>, etc., v. infr.; Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אמן</span> in deriv. & n.pr. cf. CIS <sup>iv. 1, 10</sup> DHM<sup>ZMG 1885, 598</sup>; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܡܢ</span> in Haph. Ethiopic አምነ Assyrian in deriv.<strong>)</strong>—only"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמֵן</span>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"as vb. <em>support, nourish</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.1\">2 K 10:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 2:7\" href=\"/Esther.2.7\">Est 2:7</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as subst. <em>foster-father</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:12\" href=\"/Numbers.11.12\">Nu 11:12</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.23\">Is 49:23</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמֶנֶת</span> <em>foster-mother, nurse</em> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:16\" href=\"/Ruth.4.16\">Ru 4:16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 4:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.4.4\">2 S 4:4</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמְנוֹת</span> <em>pillars, supporters of the door</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.16\">2 K 18:16</a>. Pt. pass."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֱמֻנִים</span> <em>those brought up</em> (in scarlet) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:5\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.5\">La 4:5</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">אֱמוּנִים</span> intrans. <em>faithful</em> (as firm, stable) as subst. m. <em>faithful ones</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:2\" href=\"/Psalms.12.2\">ψ 12:2</a> (> 𝔊 𝔖 al. <em>faithfulness</em>) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.19\">2 S 20:19</a> (cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أمُنَ</span> <em>be faithful</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">أَمَنَ</span> <em>trust in</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">أَمَنَ</span> <em>be secure</em>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:24\" href=\"/Psalms.31.24\">ψ 31:23</a> <em>faithful ones</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>keepeth</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱמוּנִים נֹצֵר י׳</span>; but <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> is here taken by 𝔊 Ri De Che as n. abstr. v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֵמֻן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵמֻן\">אֵמֻן</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"4."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.13\">Pr 11:13</a> + (6 times); Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵאָמֵן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵאָ֫מֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.26\">1 K 8:26</a> + (9 times); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">Pr 25:13</a> + (16 times) <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמָנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.21\">Is 1:21</a> + (4 times); <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמֶנֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:29\" href=\"/Psalms.89.29\">ψ 89:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.6\">Pr 27:6</a> + (9 times); <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:59\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.59\">Dt 28:59</a>."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>carried by a nurse</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.4\">Is 60:4</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>made firm, sure, lasting:</em> place <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.23\">Is 22:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.25\">25</a>; name <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.24\">1 Ch 17:24</a>; waters <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.16\">Is 33:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.18\">Je 15:18</a>; an event <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:9\" href=\"/Hosea.5.9\">Ho 5:9</a>; sickness <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:59\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.59\">Dt 28:59</a>; mercy <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.3\">Is 55:3</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>confirmed, established, sure:</em> kingdom <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.16\">2 S 7:16</a>; house, dynasty <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:35\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.35\">1 S 2:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.28\">25:28</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.38\">1 K 11:38</a>; prophet Samuel <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 3:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.3.20\">1 S 3:20</a>; cf. word-play <span dir=\"rtl\">אִם לֹא תַאֲמִינוּ לֹא תֵאָמֵנוּ</span> = <em>if ye believe not</em> (have not firm confidence) <em>ye will not be confirmed</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.9\">Is 7:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֲמִינוּ בי׳ וְתֵאָמֵנוּ</span> = <em>believe in Yahweh and ye will be confirmed</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.20\">2 Ch 20:20</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>verified, confirmed:</em> words of God <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.26\">1 K 8:26</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.9\">2 Ch 1:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.17\">6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.23\">17:23</a>; precepts <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:7\" href=\"/Psalms.111.7\">ψ 111:7</a>; testimonies <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:8\" href=\"/Psalms.19.8\">ψ 19:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:5\" href=\"/Psalms.93.5\">93:5</a>; covenant <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:29\" href=\"/Psalms.89.29\">ψ 89:29</a>; words of men <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:20\" href=\"/Genesis.42.20\">Gn 42:20</a> (E)."}],"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>reliable, faithful, trusty:</em> persons <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:35\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.35\">1 S 2:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.14\">22:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:20\" href=\"/Job.12.20\">Jb 12:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:38\" href=\"/Psalms.89.38\">ψ 89:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 101:6\" href=\"/Psalms.101.6\">101:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">Pr 25:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.2\">Is 8:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.13\">Ne 13:13</a>; a city <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.21\">Is 1:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">האל הנאמן</span> <em>the faithful God</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.9\">Dt 7:9</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.7\">Is 49:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאֱמַן רוּחַ</span> <em>faithful in spirit</em> (disposition) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.13\">Pr 11:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבָבוֹ נֶאֱמָן</span> <em>his heart faithful</em> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.8\">Ne 9:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד אֱמֶת וְנֶאֱמָן</span> <em>true and faithful witness</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.5\">Je 42:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נאמנים פצעי אוהב</span> <em>faithful the wounds of a friend</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.6\">Pr 27:6</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵת (אֶל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:8\" href=\"/Psalms.78.8\">ψ 78:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:1\" href=\"/Hosea.12.1\">Ho 12:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> of thing <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:37\" href=\"/Psalms.78.37\">ψ 78:37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָל־בֵּיתִי</span> <em>in all my house</em> (of Moses) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:7\" href=\"/Numbers.12.7\">Nu 12:7</a> (E)."}],"num":"5."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">הֶאֱמִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:26\" href=\"/Genesis.45.26\">Gn 45:26</a> + (18 times); Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲמִין</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאֲמֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:31\" href=\"/Job.15.31\">Jb 15:31</a> + (30 times); Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֲמִינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.20\">2 Ch 20:20</a> + (2 times); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲמִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.32\">Dt 1:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.16\">Is 28:16</a>."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>stand firm</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:24\" href=\"/Job.39.24\">Jb 39:24</a> (c. neg. of the horse when the trumpet sounds Di De MV RVm; but <em>neither believeth</em> RV, <em>hardly trusts</em> Da)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>trust, believe:</em> (<em>a</em>) abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:31\" href=\"/Exodus.4.31\">Ex 4:31</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.9\">Is 7:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.16\">28:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.5\">Hb 1:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:10\" href=\"/Psalms.116.10\">ψ 116:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:24\" href=\"/Job.29.24\">Jb 29:24</a>; (<em>b</em>) with ל of person, <em>trust to, believe</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:26\" href=\"/Genesis.45.26\">Gn 45:26</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:1\" href=\"/Exodus.4.1\">Ex 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:8\" href=\"/Exodus.4.8\">8</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.14\">Je 40:14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.15\">2 Ch 32:15</a>; with God <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.23\">Dt 9:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.10\">Is 43:10</a>; ל of thing <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:8\" href=\"/Exodus.4.8\">Ex 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:9\" href=\"/Exodus.4.9\">9</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:24\" href=\"/Psalms.106.24\">ψ 106:24</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.7\">1 K 10:7</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.6\">2 Ch 9:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.1\">Is 53:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.15\">Pr 14:15</a>; (<em>c</em>) with ב of person, <em>trust in, believe in</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:9\" href=\"/Exodus.19.9\">Ex 19:9</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.12\">1 S 27:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.20\">2 Ch 20:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:18\" href=\"/Job.4.18\">Jb 4:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 15:15\" href=\"/Job.15.15\">15:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.25\">Pr 26:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.6\">Je 12:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:5\" href=\"/Micah.7.5\">Mi 7:5</a>; the usual construction with God <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:6\" href=\"/Genesis.15.6\">Gn 15:6</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:31\" href=\"/Exodus.14.31\">Ex 14:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:11\" href=\"/Numbers.14.11\">Nu 14:11</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:12\" href=\"/Numbers.20.12\">20:12</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.32\">Dt 1:32</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.14\">2 K 17:14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.20\">2 Ch 20:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:22\" href=\"/Psalms.78.22\">ψ 78:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 3:5\" href=\"/Jonah.3.5\">Jon 3:5</a>; with ב of thing <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:66\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.66\">Dt 28:66</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:31\" href=\"/Job.15.31\">Jb 15:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:22\" href=\"/Job.24.22\">24:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 39:12\" href=\"/Job.39.12\">39:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:32\" href=\"/Psalms.78.32\">ψ 78:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:12\" href=\"/Psalms.106.12\">106:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:66\" href=\"/Psalms.119.66\">119:66</a>; (<em>d</em>) with <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי</span> <em>trust or believe that</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:5\" href=\"/Exodus.4.5\">Ex 4:5</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Job 9:16\" href=\"/Job.9.16\">Jb 9:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:12\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.12\">La 4:12</a>; (<em>e</em>) so with infin. <a data-ref=\"Job 15:22\" href=\"/Job.15.22\">Jb 15:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:13\" href=\"/Psalms.27.13\">ψ 27:13</